# =============================================================================
# CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR — portable, version-controlled Claude Code user config
#
# Strategy: IGNORE EVERYTHING by default, then explicitly ALLOW only the
# portable, non-sensitive files/folders. Anything Claude Code writes here at
# runtime (credentials, sessions, projects, shell snapshots, caches, plugins)
# stays local and untracked automatically — no need to enumerate it.
# =============================================================================

# --- Ignore every top-level entry in this directory by default ---
/*

# --- Meta files (always tracked) ---
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!README.md
!LICENSE
!SECURITY.md
!requirements-dev.txt
!settings.example.json
!.github/
!scripts/

# --- Portable, non-sensitive user config (safe to share across machines) ---
!CLAUDE.md
!skills/
!policy/
!commands/
!agents/
!hooks/
!output-styles/
!rules/
!standards/
!docs/

# --- Explicitly re-assert exclusion of known-sensitive items, in case a future
#     allow rule above ever widens scope. (Belt-and-suspenders.) ---
.credentials.json
.last-cleanup
mcp-needs-auth-cache.json
backups/
projects/
sessions/
session-env/
shell-snapshots/
file-history/
debug/
ide/
plans/
plugins/
statsig/
todos/
skills/synced/
skills/.trash/
# skill-creator eval workspaces (local only)
skills/*-workspace/

# Python bytecode from skill scripts/tests
review-history/
tdd-history/
settings.json
policy/local.env
__pycache__/
*.pyc
